    "description": "Clinical conformance resources shared by the clinically focused WHO SMART Guidelines IGs (CPG-derived profiles, WHOCommon CQL), as a harnessed instance of smart-base. It holds no process or encounter catalogue yet (bean 2ipj). Declared with no directories yet: what it holds is seeded later (n3h9, 53rv), and a declared-but-absent directory is the dh4f defect.",
